OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of great music including
OL,8,     Fperformances from the Bavarian
OL,9,     FRadio Symphony Orchestra and
OL,10,     Fchamber music from across Bavaria.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Mighty
OL,12,G     Handful
OL,13,     F5/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,14,     Flegacy of The Mighty Handful on
OL,15,     Fmodern Russian music and looks at
OL,16,     Ftheir influence over European
OL,17,     Fmusic.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FViolinist Esther Yoo and pianist
OL,20,     FIain Farrington play live in
OL,21,     Fstudio. Plus, Tine Thing Helseth
OL,22,     Fand friends play live in studio.
